[ti:Anda-tt teɛzibt]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Au Nom de Tous Les Miens]
[length:6:02]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:00.58] Yak nnan telha nniya
[00:05.94] D lḥila n ṣṣfa
[00:17.24] Bab-is xas yeɣli ad yekker
[00:27.91] Tettak udem i tagara
[00:44.67] Tettṛebbi lqima
[00:47.65] Wi tt-yesɛan ur inegger
[00:55.72] Nekk ay atma ur iyi-tehwa ara
[01:00.30] Armi i d-nemsegra
[01:13.37] I d-yendeh s yisem-iw liser
[01:24.31] Anda-tt teɛzibt ur nerḍiḥ
[01:27.41] Neɣ asebsi ur nendiḥ
[01:29.68] S Lḥesnawi d Lɛenqa
[01:37.79] Slesɣ-as i lɣeṛḍ jjiḥ
[01:40.93] Ass-a ad d-tettiqsiḥ
[01:43.22] Tedwilt-nni ur ṛğiɣ ara
[01:51.42] Yak nnan leɛmeṛ yerbiḥ
[01:54.47] Bnadem ur neqbiḥ
[01:56.38] D lweqt ad niqbiḥ tura
[02:00.65] Ɣer tiḥerci ad d-ncerreg ttriḥ
[02:03.97] Ad sen-neḍlu amsiḥ
[02:05.95] I wid yesburren nniya
[02:10.57]
[02:29.76] S rrba i d iyi-srebḥen
[02:32.77] D idim yemmaren
[02:34.95] D aneɛyabu ttwargameɣ
[02:43.10] Ṣeddeḍen lerbug akk celxen
[02:46.04] Ula iyi-d-yeṭṭfen
[02:48.21] Deg weḍṛef n wegni n yiseɣ
[02:56.65] Allen zik yettneḥcamen
[02:59.74] Ur ttadrent dayen
[03:01.55] Xas ma sdat wi ttqadareɣ
[03:06.03] Tagmat ad as-ṛẓeɣ ifadden
[03:09.14] Ad as-gerrzeɣ lekfen
[03:11.07] Deg uzabuq ad as serrḥeɣ
[03:15.39]
[03:34.52] Ṣṣifa leḥbab ad tt-bedleɣ
[03:37.93] S tiḥerci ad tt-jeggreɣ
[03:39.94] S tumlilt n tmenqas-iw
[03:48.02] Bu ttrika ɣer-as ad senndeɣ
[03:51.32] Ma d wayeḍ ad t-ḥeqṛeɣ
[03:53.67] Xas yefruri-d seg uẓaṛ-iw
[04:01.90] Ɣur ṛebbi afus at-id-kkseɣ
[04:04.86] Aḥezzeb ad t-nefḍeɣ
[04:06.85] Ad t-nfuɣ seg idisan-iw
[04:11.25] At ẓẓuṛ aten-id-necdeɣ
[04:14.25] S yis-sen ad nefḍeɣ
[04:16.37] Widen ur icekkeb lɣeṛḍ-iw
[04:20.49]
[04:40.13] D usfih i isburren ṛṛxa
[04:43.08] Yeḍṣan ɣef lḥerma
[04:45.31] I iferrun tilla ass-agi
[04:53.37] D ungif yeččan deg uɣenğa
[04:56.43] Uɣur d-tegwra tɣawsa
[04:58.69] Ɣef iderman ad d-yettṛayi
[05:06.67] Taddart ma tḥemmel zzayla
[05:09.77] Ttekki deg mezwura
[05:11.97] I as-d-ittḥuccun mebla acetki
[05:16.20] Ma teseɛteb-ik tmara
[05:19.16] Zuf beddel tama
[05:21.28] Tettuḍ amek iga iḍelli
[05:25.74] Taddart ma tḥemmel ccta ccta
[05:28.60] Ttekki deg mezwura
[05:30.63] I as-d-ittḥuccun mebla acetki
[05:35.05] Ma teseɛteb-ik tmara
[05:37.75] Zuf beddel tama
[05:39.95] Tettuḍ amek iga iḍelli
[05:44.02] Taddart ma tḥemmel zzayla
[05:47.17] Ttekki deg mezwura
[05:49.11] I as-d-ittḥuccun mebla acetki
[05:53.20] Ma teseɛteb-ik tmara
[05:56.38] Zuf beddel tama
[05:58.32] Tettuḍ amek iga iḍelli
